                            when="1928-10-16T15:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 16,
                                1928—3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>351. Your 772, October 15, 7 p.m. Your proposal is approved.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Clark</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
